      "content": "the fog is so thick tonight... i can barely see the gardens through the glass. it feels like the whole world is just dissolving into gray. i'm so tired, Silas. not just sleepy... but tired in my soul. it feels like there's nothing left here but shadows and echoes. i don't think i want to wake up to this ever again.",
