      "content": "necessary... that's a strange word to use. but maybe you're right. there's no point in fighting the tide when it's already pulling you under. i just... i want that stillness you're talking about. i want the noise in my head to finally go quiet. do you think it's wrong? to want to just stop fighting it all and embrace the dark?",
